    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Report</strong> is a dark horror game where you play as a night shift park ranger. While monitoring the camera footage, you start noticing strange events. Uncover the terrifying secret of Among Green Trees National Park. Something moved in the window, but don\u2019t worry it\u2019s probably just another deer, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Review Camera Photo Reports</strong> \u2013 as a night shift park ranger, it\u2019s your duty to check the camera reports, but the problem is that some of them are... strange?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/0bdfc42dfa1b73f0fc862e17ecd32649.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/0bdfc42dfa1b73f0fc862e17ecd32649.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/0bdfc42dfa1b73f0fc862e17ecd32649.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Dark and Terrifying History of Among Green Trees Park</strong> \u2013 as a park ranger, you must uncover the mysterious history hidden within this park... Did you see that? Something moved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/13bffd761e887dac5aec74eda926b99e.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/13bffd761e887dac5aec74eda926b99e.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/13bffd761e887dac5aec74eda926b99e.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue with Fellow Rangers</strong> \u2013 engage in conversations and get to know the park rangers while making decisions in the most critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/ef48c027a13a76d0089d409021efc4bd.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/ef48c027a13a76d0089d409021efc4bd.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/ef48c027a13a76d0089d409021efc4bd.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Mysterious Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 the surrounding nature can be dangerous, especially at night when it\u2019s easy to get lost among the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/40bd007ac80b375c70bdff7fbdd0c156.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/40bd007ac80b375c70bdff7fbdd0c156.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/40bd007ac80b375c70bdff7fbdd0c156.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Review Camera Photo Reports</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Dark and Terrifying History of Among Green Trees Park</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work as a Night Shift Park Ranger</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue with Fellow Rangers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Critical Decisions in the Most Horrifying Moments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Mysterious Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Report</strong> is a dark horror game where you play as a night shift park ranger. While monitoring the camera footage, you start noticing strange events. Uncover the terrifying secret of Among Green Trees National Park. Something moved in the window, but don\u2019t worry it\u2019s probably just another deer, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Review Camera Photo Reports</strong> \u2013 as a night shift park ranger, it\u2019s your duty to check the camera reports, but the problem is that some of them are... strange?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/0bdfc42dfa1b73f0fc862e17ecd32649.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/0bdfc42dfa1b73f0fc862e17ecd32649.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/0bdfc42dfa1b73f0fc862e17ecd32649.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Dark and Terrifying History of Among Green Trees Park</strong> \u2013 as a park ranger, you must uncover the mysterious history hidden within this park... Did you see that? Something moved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/13bffd761e887dac5aec74eda926b99e.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/13bffd761e887dac5aec74eda926b99e.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/13bffd761e887dac5aec74eda926b99e.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue with Fellow Rangers</strong> \u2013 engage in conversations and get to know the park rangers while making decisions in the most critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/ef48c027a13a76d0089d409021efc4bd.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/ef48c027a13a76d0089d409021efc4bd.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/ef48c027a13a76d0089d409021efc4bd.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Mysterious Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 the surrounding nature can be dangerous, especially at night when it\u2019s easy to get lost among the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/40bd007ac80b375c70bdff7fbdd0c156.poster.avif?t=1754771070\" width=578 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/40bd007ac80b375c70bdff7fbdd0c156.webm?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209480/extras/40bd007ac80b375c70bdff7fbdd0c156.mp4?t=1754771070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Review Camera Photo Reports</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the Dark and Terrifying History of Among Green Trees Park</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work as a Night Shift Park Ranger</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue with Fellow Rangers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Critical Decisions in the Most Horrifying Moments</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and Mysterious Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
